  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent v9 only (inherited from engine); `SendEmailDialog` uses the Fluent `Dialog` primitive.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">No `@spaarke/auth` import — `authenticatedFetch` injected via props.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Wrappers live in `@spaarke/ui-components`; exported via the lib barrel; no fork, no cross-package source import.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-045">Thin wrappers — engine is the only place with send logic; each wrapper ≤~60 LOC and only locks `mount` + shapes props.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">`SendEmailStep` locks `mount='inline'`; `SendEmailDialog` locks `mount='dialog'`; `SendEmailPage` locks `mount='page'` — hosts cannot override.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">`SendEmailStep` forwards `composerRef` (host owns Send/Finish). `SendEmailDialog` owns open/close + maps `onSent`. `SendEmailPage` requires `mode` + maps `onClose`→`onCancel`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">No BFF publish-size / CVE obligations — client-only.</constraint>
  </constraints>

