  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read `reference/r3-send-side-design.md` §5.1.1/§5.1.2/§5.3 for the exact wrapper prop interfaces + delegation. Read `EmailComposer.tsx` + `EmailComposer.types.ts` to confirm engine prop names + `IEmailComposerHandle`.</step>
    <step order="2">Author `SendEmailStep.tsx` — `forwardRef&lt;IEmailComposerHandle, ISendEmailStepProps&gt;` rendering `&lt;EmailComposer mount='inline' mode={props.mode ?? 'compose'} ref={ref} {...rest} /&gt;`. Define `ISendEmailStepProps` reusing engine types.</step>
    <step order="3">Author `SendEmailDialog.tsx` — locks `mount='dialog'`, wraps the engine in a Fluent `Dialog` keyed on `open`; wires `onSent` → `props.onSent?.(communicationId)` then `onClose()`; maps `onCancel` → `onClose`. Define `ISendEmailDialogProps`.</step>
    <step order="4">Author `SendEmailPage.tsx` — locks `mount='page'`, requires `mode`, maps `onClose` → engine `onCancel`. Define `ISendEmailPageProps`.</step>
    <step order="5">Update `EmailComposer/index.ts` — export the three wrappers + `ISendEmailStepProps`/`ISendEmailDialogProps`/`ISendEmailPageProps`. Confirm they flow through the shared-lib `src/index.ts` barrel.</step>
    <step order="6">Verify each wrapper file is ≤~60 LOC. Grep-verify no `@spaarke/auth` import.</step>
    <step order="7">Run `npm run build:prod` + `npm run lint` in `@spaarke/ui-components` — both clean.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: invoke `code-review` on the three wrappers; invoke `adr-check` against ADR-021, ADR-028, ADR-012, ADR-045. Address Critical + High findings.</step>
    <step order="10">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md`: mark 021 ✅; confirm 060 + 061 dependencies satisfied.</step>
    <step order="11">Update `current-task.md` per task-execute protocol: status → completed; advance to next pending W2 task.</step>
  </steps>

